        ],
        "font_size": 12.0,
        "raw_text": "This paper is included in the Proceedings of the 32nd USENIX Security Symposium. August 9-11, 2023 • Anaheim, CA, USA 978-1-939133-37-3 Open access to the Proceedings of the 32nd USENIX Security Symposium is sponsored by USENIX.",
